#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:2
msgid "Deployment Guide"
msgstr "배포 가이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Welcome to deployment guidance for Mattermost. This guide is organized "
"into sections based on application types and deployment scenarios to help"
" you achieve a successful deployment of Mattermost across various "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 배포 안내에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 이 가이드는 다양한 플랫폼에서 "
"OKR.BEST를 성공적으로 배포할 수 있도록 애플리케이션 유형과 배포 시나리오에 "
"따라 섹션으로 구성되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Whether you're deploying the server application, desktop application, or "
"mobile application, or troubleshooting deployments, this guide has you "
"covered. Use the navigation below to access detailed information about "
"each topic."
msgstr ""
"서버 애플리케이션, 데스크톱 애플리케이션, 모바일 애플리케이션을 배포하거나 "
"배포 문제를 해결할 때 이 가이드가 도움이 됩니다. 아래 내비게이션을 사용해 각 "
"주제에 대한 자세한 정보를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`Quick Start Evaluation </deployment-guide/quick-start-evaluation>` "
"- A quick start guide to help you get started with Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`빠른 시작 평가 </deployment-guide/quick-start-evaluation>` - "
"OKR.BEST를 시작하는 데 도움이 되는 빠른 시작 가이드입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`Reference Architecture </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/reference-architecture-index>` - Reference architectures for scaling "
"Mattermost and specialized deployment scenarios."
msgstr ""
":doc:`참조 아키텍처 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/reference-"
"architecture-index>` - OKR.BEST 확장과 특수 배포 시나리오를 위한 참조 "
"아키텍처입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Server deployment </deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-"
"planning>` - Pre-deployment checks, security considerations, hardware "
"recommendations, software prerequisites, and step-by-step guidance to "
"deploying Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
":doc:`서버 배포 </deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-planning>` - 배포 "
"전 점검, 보안 고려 사항, 하드웨어 권장 사항, 소프트웨어 사전 요건, 그리고 "
"OKR.BEST 서버 배포에 대한 단계별 안내입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:24
msgid ""
":doc:`Calls Deployment Guide </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"deployment-guide>` - Deploy and operate Mattermost Calls infrastructure, "
"including RTCD, recording services, and supporting network configuration."
msgstr ""
":doc:`통화 배포 가이드 </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>` - RTCD, 녹화 서비스, 지원 네트워크 구성을 포함한 OKR.BEST 통화 "
"인프라를 배포하고 운영합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:25
msgid ""
":doc:`Desktop deployment </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-"
"deployment>` - Installation procedures for Mattermost's desktop "
"applications across Windows, macOS, and Linux, and large-scale, "
"enterprise-wide deployments."
msgstr ""
":doc:`데스크톱 배포 </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` - "
"Windows, macOS, Linux 전반의 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 애플리케이션 설치 절차와 "
"대규모 전사 배포입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:26
msgid ""
":doc:`Mobile deployment </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>`"
" - How to set up push notifications using Mattermost's notification "
"service and troubleshooting tips."
msgstr ""
":doc:`모바일 배포 </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>` - "
"OKR.BEST 알림 서비스를 사용해 푸시 알림을 설정하는 방법과 문제 해결 팁입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:27
msgid ""
":doc:`Deployment troubleshooting </deployment-guide/deployment-"
"troubleshooting>` - Best practices for diagnosing and resolving common "
"deployment issues."
msgstr ""
":doc:`배포 문제 해결 </deployment-guide/deployment-troubleshooting>` - 흔한 "
"배포 문제를 진단하고 해결하기 위한 모범 사례입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:30
msgid "How to use this guide"
msgstr "이 가이드 사용 방법"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:32
msgid ""
"Navigate through the sections using the headings above to find the "
"deployment instructions and troubleshooting steps pertinent to your "
"needs. Each section is designed to provide clear, actionable information "
"to ensure a successful deployment and operation of Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"위의 제목을 사용해 섹션을 탐색하여 필요에 맞는 배포 지침과 문제 해결 단계를 "
"찾으세요. 각 섹션은 OKR.BEST의 성공적인 배포와 운영을 보장하기 위해 "
"명확하고 실행 가능한 정보를 제공하도록 구성되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you are new to Mattermost, we recommend starting with the Application "
"Architecture section to understand the prerequisites and get started, or "
"alternatively use the Try Mattermost section to explore Mattermost before"
" planning your production deployment."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST를 처음 사용한다면, 사전 요건을 이해하고 시작하기 위해 애플리케이션 "
"아키텍처 섹션부터 시작하거나, 프로덕션 배포를 계획하기 전에 OKR.BEST 체험 "
"섹션을 사용해 OKR.BEST를 살펴볼 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:38
msgid "If you encounter issues that aren't covered in this documentation:"
msgstr "이 문서에서 다루지 않는 문제가 발생하면:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:40
msgid ""
"Customers with a Mattermost subscription: See the `Mattermost Support "
"Knowledge Base <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us>`_, or `contact "
"Mattermost Support <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/requests/new>`_ for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 구독 고객: `Mattermost 지원 기술 자료 "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us>`_\\ 를 참고하거나 `Mattermost "
"지원팀에 문의 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 하여 "
"도움을 받으세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:41
msgid ""
"Community deployments: Reference the `Mattermost community forums "
"<https://forum.mattermost.com/>`_"
msgstr ""
"커뮤니티 배포: `Mattermost 커뮤니티 포럼 "
"<https://forum.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 을 참고하세요"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:42
msgid ""
"For advanced customization or integrations, refer to the :doc:`Open "
"source components </administration-guide/upgrade/open-source-components>`"
" documentation for details about extending Mattermost functionality."
msgstr ""
"고급 커스터마이징이나 통합은 OKR.BEST 기능 확장에 대한 자세한 내용을 다루는 "
":doc:`오픈소스 구성 요소 </administration-guide/upgrade/open-source-"
"components>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.rst:44
msgid "Enjoy deploying Mattermost with confidence!"
msgstr "자신 있게 OKR.BEST를 배포하세요!"

